OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 3 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,5,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,6,     GHildegard's secretaries prepare
OL,7,     Gto preserve the story of her
OL,8,     Glife. With Donald Macleod.
OL,9,G1700FIn Tune
OL,10,     GKate Derham is joined for live
OL,11,     Gmusic in studio by soprano Olivia
OL,12,     GWarburton and guitarist Samrat
OL,13,     GMajumder ahead of their
OL,14,     Gperformance at the Big House Arts
OL,15,     GFestival in Lincoln.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GHalf an hour of back to back
OL,18,     Gclassical music including some
OL,19,     GGood Friday themed works by
OL,20,     GBuxtehude, William Walton, and
OL,21,     Gthe Medieval ensemble Joglaresa.
